Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.04,0:00:05.66,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}destination, and current arrival estimate
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.33,0:00:06.55,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}地和当前抵达估计放在一起看。
