Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.55,0:00:11.19,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}路线合法，只说明这次可以这样走；沿途能否
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.31,0:00:13.13,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}Whether the army can rest along the way, and
