Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.59,0:00:19.44,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}把当前库存、缺员、下一步地点和警告
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.94,0:00:16.39,English,en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}checks.
